DESCRIPTION:Dive into the sonic waves of Quinn Sternberg's Mind Beach—wh
 ere jazz becomes a landscape and every note washes over you like tide meet
 ing shore.\n\nThis isn't your typical Monday night. It's an expedition int
 o the spaces between beats\, where four master musicians construct entire 
