 s as your anchor\, holding gravity steady while Jacob Rodriguez's baritone
  sax paints horizons in deep indigo. Joe Enright's drums pulse like the he
 artbeat beneath sand\, and Alex Taub's piano keys shimmer like moonlight o
 n water.\n\nMind Beach isn't a place—it's a state of being. It's where m
